 "method": "One reviewer rated the 18 answers in a packet that showed each under a neutral ID, in an order fixed before any answer existed, with the frozen rubric and the text of every passage the answer cites; how an answer was produced, call and search counts, costs and timings were withheld. Per answer: support and relevance of every claim, coverage of every required claim, the gaps a good answer names, listed and other errors, whether the status fits the answer's claims and cited passages, and an overall verdict. The ratings were fixed by hash before the key was opened (lock), then joined to the key by this summary's local script. Retrieval figures are computed deterministically from the saved requests and the frozen gold evidence (edition, page and quote, NFC and whitespace folded); they are not answer quality.",
