 "limitations": [
  "One run per case and condition with one model (claude-opus-5-5, effort max, adaptive thinking); no repeat, no variance estimate.",
  "Six cases (five primary), drafted by Claude and decided by Erhan; one reviewer, who also decided the cases; no second rater, no agreement measure.",
  "Partial blinding: answers were shown verbatim, so wording or the number of passages cited can hint at the condition; the reviewer was asked not to use such hints.",
  "E1 overlaps D1 and is reported apart. On the January-only cases E4 and E5, fixed10 receives 10 of the January commentary's 11 passages. E2's edition filter excludes January for every condition, so E2 does not test edition selection.",
  "E6 has no required evidence items: Evidence Recall is N/A there. A required claim of kind gap is scored by the reviewer and adds no evidence item.",
  "Costs are calculated from reported usage and pricing.json, not invoices. Output and thinking tokens dominate each cell's cost and differ widely between cells; with one run per cell no repeatable cost difference between the conditions is established."
 ],
